<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Splunk Synthetics on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/</link><description>Recent content in Splunk Synthetics on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>pt-BR</language><atom:link href="https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>1. Dashboard de Synthetics</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/1-synthetics-dashboard/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/1-synthetics-dashboard/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;No Splunk Observability Cloud, no menu principal, clique em &lt;strong&gt;Synthetics&lt;/strong&gt;. Clique em &lt;strong&gt;All&lt;/strong&gt; ou &lt;strong&gt;Browser tests&lt;/strong&gt; para ver a lista de testes ativos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Durante nossa investigação na seção RUM, descobrimos que havia um problema com a transação &lt;strong&gt;Place Order&lt;/strong&gt;. Vamos ver se podemos confirmar isso também no teste Synthetics. Usaremos a métrica &lt;strong&gt;Tempo do primeiro byte&lt;/strong&gt; para a 4ª página do teste, que é a etapa &lt;strong&gt;Place Order&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class="exercise"&gt;
&lt;header class="exercise__bar"&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-label"&gt;Exercício&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-divider" aria-hidden="true"&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-title"&gt;Analise o desempenho do seu teste&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__panel"&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__body"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Na caixa &lt;strong&gt;Search&lt;/strong&gt; digite &lt;strong&gt;[WORKSHOP NAME]&lt;/strong&gt; e selecione o teste para o seu workshop (seu instrutor irá aconselhar qual deles selecionar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Em &lt;strong&gt;Performance KPIs&lt;/strong&gt;, defina o Seletor de tempo como &lt;strong&gt;Last 1 hour&lt;/strong&gt; e pressione Enter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clique em &lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt; e no menu suspenso selecione &lt;strong&gt;Page&lt;/strong&gt;. O próximo filtro será preenchido com as páginas que fazem parte do teste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clique em &lt;strong&gt;Duration&lt;/strong&gt;, desmarque &lt;strong&gt;Duration&lt;/strong&gt; e selecione &lt;strong&gt;Tempo do primeiro byte&lt;/strong&gt;.
&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/synthetics-transaction-filter.png" alt="Filtro de transação" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observe a legenda e observe a cor de &lt;strong&gt;Tempo do primeiro byte - Página 4&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selecione o ponto de dados mais alto para &lt;strong&gt;Tempo do primeiro byte - Página 4&lt;/strong&gt;. Agora você será levado ao &lt;strong&gt;Run results&lt;/strong&gt; para esta execução de teste específica.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;</description></item><item><title>2. Detalhe do teste de Synthetics</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/2-synthetics-detail/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/2-synthetics-detail/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;No momento, estamos analisando o resultado de um único teste de navegador sintético. Este teste é dividido em &lt;strong&gt;Business Transactions&lt;/strong&gt;. Pense nele como um grupo de uma ou mais interações relacionadas logicamente que representam um fluxo de usuário crítico para os negócios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Informações&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;A captura de tela abaixo não contém um banner vermelho com um erro, mas você pode ver um nos resultados da execução. Isto é esperado, pois em alguns casos o teste falha e não afeta o workshop.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/synth-waterfall.png" alt="cachoeira" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3. Synthetics para APM</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/3-synthetics-to-apm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/3-synthetics-to-apm/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Agora devemos ter uma visão semelhante à abaixo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/run-results-place-order.png" alt="Fazer pedido" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class="exercise"&gt;
&lt;header class="exercise__bar"&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-label"&gt;Exercício&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-divider" aria-hidden="true"&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-title"&gt;Salte de Sintéticos para APM&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__panel"&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__body"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Na cascata, encontre uma entrada que comece com &lt;strong&gt;POST checkout&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clique no botão &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; na frente dele para abrir a seção de metadados. Observe os metadados coletados e observe o cabeçalho &lt;strong&gt;Server-Timing&lt;/strong&gt;. Este cabeçalho é o que nos permite correlacionar a execução do teste a um rastreamento de back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clique no link azul &lt;span class="inline-icon"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;APM&lt;/strong&gt; na linha &lt;strong&gt;POST checkout&lt;/strong&gt; na cascata.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/apm-trace.png" alt="Rastreamento de APM" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>4. Detector de Synthetics</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/4-synthetics-detector/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/8-synthetics/4-synthetics-detector/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Dado que você pode executar esses testes 24 horas por dia, 7 dias por semana, é uma ferramenta ideal para ser avisado antecipadamente se seus testes estiverem falhando ou começando a durar mais do que o SLA acordado, em vez de ser informado pelas mídias sociais ou sites do Uptime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/social-media-post.png" alt="Mídia social" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para impedir que isso aconteça, vamos detectar se nosso teste está demorando mais de 1,1 minuto.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;section class="exercise"&gt;
&lt;header class="exercise__bar"&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-label"&gt;Exercício&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-divider" aria-hidden="true"&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-title"&gt;Crie um detector sintético&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__panel"&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__body"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Volte para a página inicial do Synthetics através do menu à esquerda&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>